(3) The percentage of aggregate voting power is calculated by dividing the voting power of the Class A ordinary shares beneficially owned by each Reporting Person by the total voting power of all ordinary shares of the Issuer, based on 191,152,162 Class A ordinary shares (one vote per share) and 44,399,922 Class V ordinary shares (ten votes per share) outstanding as of December 31, 2025, as reported in the Prospectus Supplement.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Reporting Person - Shinning Stone Invest Co., Ltd.
